      "text": "terrible thing that I will do with thee, Ex. 34:10. mighty God and terrible, Deut. 7:21. terrible God, that keepeth covenant, Neh. 1:5 (4:14; 9:32). Lord most high is terrible, Ps. 47:2. By terrible things in righteousness wilt thou answer, Ps. 65:5. he is terrible to the kings of the earth, Ps. 76:12. terrible things by the Red sea, Ps. 106:22. might of thy terrible acts, Ps. 145:6. will lay low the haughtiness of the terrible, Isa. 13:11 (2 Ne. 23:11). thou didst terrible things which we looked not for, Isa. 64:3 (D&C 133:43). Lord is with me as a mighty terrible one, Jer. 20:11. day of the Lord is great and very terrible, Joel 2:11.",
